# Internal planning / tracking docs — NOT part of the release.
planning/

# Operational research corpus (fork #1, execution-plan v2) — OPERATIONAL-ONLY.
# Corpus DATA lives here on this host only: never tracked, never pushed, never
# seeded with the project, never baked into images. The loader CODE ships
# in-repo (src/legba/data/seed/... + scripts/); the DATA does not. Per-chunk
# license/provenance metadata is still recorded (hygiene + future options).
corpora/

# Curated seed DATA — OUR data, NOT part of the public project (per operator
# 2026-07-09). The seed MACHINERY (src/legba/data/seed/**, scripts/seed*.py,
# the adapters) ships; the DATA does not. Provide your own — see seeds/README.md.
seeds/*.yaml
!seeds/*.example.yaml
scripts/backfill/seed_data.sql
scripts/seed_data.py
